%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e8c9432b0a646bd05bdb190c36673ec7, type: 3}
  m_Name: WardFieldOrders
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AthenHill.Runtime::AthenHill.FieldOrderSet
  orders:
  - id: order_steady_hands
    title: Steady Hands
    goal: 0
    targetItemId: grip_stabilised_pistol
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 1
    activateEncounter: 
    guidance: depot
    reportTo: npc_brann
    reportBrief: Take the servo to Brann at Salvage, on the north avenue inside the walls. His workbench can make the {item}.
    reportGuidance: dealer
    brief: Salvage a worker-droid servo at the machine depot, then take it to Brann at Salvage for a steadier pistol grip.
    startLine: 
    completeLine: Stabilised grip tested. Your pistol holds steadier.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 0
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_kit_helmet
    title: 'Warden Kit: Helm'
    goal: 3
    targetItemId: field_helmet
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: 
    guidance: 
    reportTo: npc_brann
    reportBrief: Take what you've scavenged to Brann at Salvage, on the north avenue inside the walls. His bench rolls the plate and rivets it into the {item}.
    reportGuidance: dealer
    brief: Wardens build their own kit. Scavenge the Outer Berms for strap webbing (scrap heaps), padded liner (wrecks) and rivet stock (droids), roll alloy plate at Brann's bench from scrap alloy and nanites, then build the {item}.
    startLine: That grip will do. Now cover yourself. Wardens don't hand out kit; we build it. Webbing turns up in the scrap heaps, liner in the wrecks, rivets on the droids. Brann's bench rolls alloy into plate. A helm first. Show Brann what you find.
    completeLine: That's a Warden helm, built in Ward. Wear it in your loadout, head slot. Ugly, but it turns a drone's dart.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 10
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_kit_arms
    title: 'Warden Kit: Bracers'
    goal: 3
    targetItemId: field_armguards
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: 
    guidance: 
    reportTo: 
    reportBrief: 
    reportGuidance: 
    brief: More webbing and rivets from across the Berms, two alloy plates from Brann's bench, then build the {item}.
    startLine: A helm won't stop a clamp to the forearm. Bracers next. More plate, webbing and rivets. The heaps further out haven't been picked over.
    completeLine: Bracers built. Strap them on and keep your forearms up when a worker swings.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 10
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_kit_hands
    title: 'Warden Kit: Gloves'
    goal: 3
    targetItemId: field_gloves
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: 
    guidance: 
    reportTo: 
    reportBrief: 
    reportGuidance: 
    brief: Webbing, a padded liner, rivets and copper filament to wire-stitch the palms. Build the {item} at Brann's bench.
    startLine: Gloves now. Webbing, a liner and rivets, and copper filament to stitch the palms. Your grip on that pistol will thank you.
    completeLine: Gloves built. Wear them in your loadout; a sure grip is half a steady shot.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 10
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_kit_legs
    title: 'Warden Kit: Leg Plates'
    goal: 3
    targetItemId: field_leggings
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: 
    guidance: 
    reportTo: 
    reportBrief: 
    reportGuidance: 
    brief: The heaviest piece. Three alloy plates, two padded liners, webbing and rivets. Search the far wrecks, outpost lockers and heaps, then build the {item} at Brann's bench.
    startLine: Last piece, and the heaviest. Leg plates. Three plates and two liners. The far wrecks and the outpost lockers still have liner in them. Finish the set and you'll walk the Berms like a Warden.
    completeLine: A full Warden kit, built with your own hands. Wear it all. Now you look like you belong out here.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 20
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_long_arm
    title: Long Arm
    goal: 3
    targetItemId: field_rifle
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: relay_knoll
    guidance: relay_knoll
    reportTo: npc_brann
    reportBrief: Take the receiver to Brann at Salvage, on the north avenue inside the walls. His workbench can build the {item} around it.
    reportGuidance: dealer
    brief: Feral gunner droids on the relay knoll, west along the Warden trail past the waystation, carry Warden-pattern rifle receivers on their racks. Put one down and bring the receiver, with alloy and filament, to Brann.
    startLine: You're kitted out and your pistol's steadier. Now a long arm. The gunner droids nesting on the relay knoll, west past the waystation, strip rifles off dead Wardens; the receivers are still on their racks. Put one down, take the receiver to Brann, and train your rifle hand in the pack before you carry it.
    completeLine: A Warden rifle, built in Ward. Train Rifle in your pack to carry it, equip it in your loadout, and press 8 out here to draw it. Hold fire; it runs bursts on the same charge.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: Gunner has a line on you. Its laser walks before it fires. Move off the line, then put rounds in the optic.
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 20
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_plate_carrier
    title: Plate Carrier
    goal: 1
    targetItemId: warden_plate_carrier
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: caravan
    guidance: caravan
    reportTo: 
    reportBrief: 
    reportGuidance: 
    brief: A Warden plate carrier went down with the caravan ambushed north of the trail, past the northgate drones. Clear the scavengers and take it from the caravan strongbox, then wear it in your chest slot.
    startLine: One more before the Foreman. A caravan went down north of the trail, past the northgate drones; scavenger droids are still picking it. A Warden plate carrier is in the strongbox. Bring it back and wear it. The Berms hit harder further out.
    completeLine: Plate carrier recovered. Put it on in your loadout, chest slot. It will take a gunner bolt that would have put you down.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 20
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_keep_charge
    title: Keep the Charge
    goal: 0
    targetItemId: cell_salvaged_capacitor
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: 
    guidance: depot
    reportTo: 
    reportBrief: 
    reportGuidance: 
    brief: 'Build a bigger nano cell: wind a copper coil, seal two micro capacitors into a charge core, then fabricate and fit the {item}.'
    startLine: That pistol runs dry after a dozen shots. I've sent charge-cell schematics to Brann's bench. Scrap drones carry micro capacitors, and the scrap heaps hide a few. Wind a coil, seal a core, fit the cell.
    completeLine: That cell holds a proper charge now. You'll outlast a drone swarm.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 20
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_bore_true
    title: Bore It True
    goal: 0
    targetItemId: barrel_bored_alloy
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: 
    guidance: depot
    reportTo: 
    reportBrief: 
    reportGuidance: 
    brief: Press scrap alloy into refined plates, wind a coil, then fabricate and fit the {item}.
    startLine: 'Your barrel is rolled sheet scrap. Brann''s bench can press alloy into proper plate: three measures of alloy and two of nanites a plate. Bore a true barrel and your shots will hit like they mean it.'
    completeLine: Now it hits like it means it. The workers won't shrug that off.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 25
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_depot_foreman
    title: The Depot Foreman
    goal: 1
    targetItemId: foreman_control_core
    targetGroup: 0
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: foreman
    guidance: foreman
    reportTo: 
    reportBrief: 
    reportGuidance: 
    brief: Destroy the Depot Foreman in the processing hall and recover the {item} from its wreck.
    startLine: 'Listen. Something big just woke in the depot''s processing hall: a foreman unit, still running its old shift. It''s slow, but it hits hard and shrugs off a stagger. When its optics flare red, step back. Put it down and bring me its control core.'
    completeLine: That core still holds its shift schedules, and Mark II pistol schematics with them. They're on Brann's bench now.
    urgentStart: 1
    engageLine: 'It''s seen you. When its optics flare red, a slam is coming: step back out of reach.'
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 40
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  - id: order_mark_two
    title: Mark II
    goal: 2
    targetItemId: 
    targetGroup: 2
    requireTestFire: 0
    activateEncounter: 
    guidance: foreman
    reportTo: 
    reportBrief: 
    reportGuidance: 
    brief: Fabricate any Mark II pistol mod. The foreman carries actuators and quantum lattice shards, and its cradle keeps reviving it.
    startLine: 'Mark II work needs rare parts: intact actuators and quantum lattice shards. The foreman carries both, and its charging cradle keeps reviving it. Build me something Warden-grade.'
    completeLine: That's Warden-grade work. The Berms are yours to hunt now; the depot always fills up again.
    urgentStart: 0
    engageLine: 
    speaker: Warden Ossa
    rewardCredits: 50
    rewardItems: []
    rewardRecipes: []
  gatherFormat: '{brief}
    {recipe}: {inputs}'
  fabricateFormat: Fabricate the {item} at Brann's workbench in Salvage, on the north avenue.
  fitFormat: Fit the {item} to your {weapon} at Brann's workbench in Salvage.
  testFireFormat: Fire your upgraded pistol in the Outer Berms.
  collectFormat: '{brief}'
  craftGroupFormat: '{brief}
    Known schematics: {count}'
  inputFormat: '{name} {have}/{need}'
  inputSeparator: " \xB7 "
  freePlayObjective: 'Free hunting: the Depot Foreman re-forms in the processing hall. Recover lattice shards and actuators for the other Mark II mods, and sell surplus salvage to Brann at Salvage or Mira at Basic General. Past the fans and the washes, Post sentinels and Scrap Reapers hold the far caches: take the field rifle and a full set of plate, and when they fall easily you are ready for the next region.'
  freePlayGuidance: 
  nextLineDelay: 4.5
